        "m_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Store extras in the fridge for up to 3 days. Jason likes this one cold, so there’s no need to reheat: keep the salsa, salmon and greens separate, and spoon on the vinaigrette when you eat.</p><p>Thaw the fillets in the fridge overnight, and pat them dry before they go on the grill.</p>",
