        "f_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our King Salmon comes from Ōra King in New Zealand, in skin-on 8.5 oz portions.</p><p>Our King Salmon tested at 1,140 mg EPA and 2,290 mg DHA, about 3,430 mg of marine omega-3s, plus 64 mcg selenium, per 8.5 oz skin-on portion. Values vary by sample and season.</p><p>Low mercury, tested to a tenth of the FDA action level. Every supplier is third-party tested for nutrition, mercury and microplastics, then randomly audited to ensure consistent compliance with the Seatopia Standard. Farms named, panels published.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
